Package: causalbenchmarks
Title: API Wrapper for causalbenchmarks.org
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Beniamino", "Green", , "beniamino.green@yale.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: causalbenchmarks.org allows users to benchmark causal inference algorithms on a set of commonly-accepted benchmarks. 
  This package further streamlines the process of interacting with the API for R users. 
